  "title": "A FORMULA OF ARTHUR AND AFFINE HECKE ALGEBRAS",
  "authors_raw": "ERIC OPDAM AND MAARTEN SOLLEVELD",
  "title_lines": [
   "A FORMULA OF ARTHUR AND AFFINE HECKE ALGEBRAS"
  ],
  "abstract": "Let \u03c0, \u03c0 \u2032 be tempered representations of an a\ufb03ne Hecke algebra with positive parameters. We study their Euler\u2013Poincar\u00b4 e pairing EP (\u03c0, \u03c0 \u2032), the alter- nating sum of the dimensions of the Ext-groups. We show that EP (\u03c0, \u03c0 \u2032) can be expressed in a simple formula involving an analytic R-group , analogous to a for- mula of Arthur in the setting of reductive p-adic groups. Our proof applies equally well to a\ufb03ne Hecke algebras and to reductive groups over nona rchimedean local \ufb01elds of arbitrary characteristic.",
